    "snippet": "* Isolated thunderstorms are possible this afternoon and Thursday afternoon for portions of the area, particularly Mohave County and portions of San Bernardino County on Thursday. Precipitable water values in this area remain around 1 inch, and while instability is fairly weak, diurnal heating over higher terrain is expected to result in a few isolated showers and thunderstorms this afternoon through sunset.",
